        "$2ar - 14 = a + ar^2 - 22$.",
        "$a + ar^2 - 2ar = 8$.",
        "Use $a(1+r^2) = 56 - ar$. Substitute.",
        "$56 - ar - 2ar = 8 \\implies 3ar = 48 \\implies ar = 16$.",
        "$a(16/a) = 16$. $r = 16/a$.",
        "Substitute in sum: $a + 16 + 256/a = 56$.",
        "$a^2 - 40a + 256 = 0$. $a=8, 32$."
